# You write the header, the trust you give each input, and the Checks.
# The AI writes the body. It is a claim until your Checks witness it.
To classify given signal, answering a Text:
  signal is a Float, trusted 100 of 256.
  It never repeats.
  Make sure signal is not void.
  Let threshold be a Float, trusted 256 of 256, equal to 128.
  If the signal is greater than the threshold:
    Answer "Certain".
  Otherwise:
    Answer "Uncertain".
Check: classify of 200 gives "Certain", trusted 100.
Check: classify of 50 gives "Uncertain", trusted 100.
Check: classify of 128 gives "Uncertain", trusted 100.
